    "code": "class Solution:\r\n    def flowerGame(self, n: int, m: int) -> int:\r\n        a1 = (n + 1) // 2\r\n        b1 = (m + 1) // 2\r\n        a2 = n // 2\r\n        b2 = m // 2\r\n        return a1 * b2 + a2 * b1",
